OL,3,APolice investigations continue after
OL,4,ABritish citizen among six killed in
OL,5,AKrakow shooting
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolish police are continuing to
OL,8,Finvestigate after six people were
OL,9,Fkilled when a gunman opened fire in
OL,10,FKrakow on Saturday - here's what we
OL,11,Fknow
OL,13,FThe head of Poland's police force,
OL,14,FMarek BoroED, said 16 more people were
OL,15,Finjured, including two police officers,
OL,16,Ffive foreign nationals and the suspect
OL,18,FHours after the attack, Polish PM
OL,19,FDonald Tusk said three other bodies had
OL,20,Fbeen found at the suspect's home, with
OL,21,F"strong indications" they are family
OL,22,Fmembers
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
