OL,3,APolice investigations continue after
OL,4,ABritish citizen among six killed in
OL,5,AKrakow shooting
OL,6,
OL,7,FPoland's interior minister described
OL,8,Fthe suspect - a 25-year-old Polish
OL,9,Fcitizen - as being inspired by
OL,10,F"far-right ideologies", while police
OL,11,Fsaid he used "military weapons" in the
OL,12,Fattack
